[CHANGE] benchmark_4/parts/inter_interface/pretense/vault_impl_pretense.py: Resolved transition_frequency_starvation coverage feedback: the Vault impl pseudo-state machine now mirrors the contracted failure branches of the interface machine, verifying InsufficientFundsError around the pivot for non-positive deposit amounts and for non-positive or balance-exceeding withdrawals, plus VaultInactiveException for inactive deposit and inactive withdrawal. TestVaultImplReal adds deterministic scenarios for deposit(0)/deposit(-5)/withdraw(0)/withdraw(balance+1) and inactive withdraw(2), so all three blamed contract outcomes are exercised and verified deterministically while balance invariants are asserted.
